      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 1 · INGRESS GUARDRAIL\nguardrails/ingress.py\n\n1. deterministic_scan()  regex · ~0ms · $0 · unpromptable\n2. classifier (gpt-4o-mini)  catches paraphrase\n\nA regex hit is FINAL — except past-tense narratives,\nwhere the classifier arbitrates on tense.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "l1",
      "originalText": "LAYER 1 · INGRESS GUARDRAIL\nguardrails/ingress.py\n\n1. deterministic_scan()  regex · ~0ms · $0 · unpromptable\n2. classifier (gpt-4o-mini)  catches paraphrase\n\nA regex hit is FINAL — except past-tense narratives,\nwhere the classifier arbitrates on tense.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
