      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LAYER 3 · CONTEXT ASSEMBLY\nprompts/render.py  +  knowledge/retrieval.py\n\nThree tiers, ordered by volatility:\n\n  Tier 1  persona / style / safety policy   (stable)\n  Tier 2  session state, filled slots       (slow)\n  Tier 3  facts for THIS intent only        (per turn)\n\nIntent-keyed topic index — not vector search.\nA turn carries 5–20 facts, not all 47.\nRetrieved fact IDs are recorded for Layer 5.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "l3",
      "originalText": "LAYER 3 · CONTEXT ASSEMBLY\nprompts/render.py  +  knowledge/retrieval.py\n\nThree tiers, ordered by volatility:\n\n  Tier 1  persona / style / safety policy   (stable)\n  Tier 2  session state, filled slots       (slow)\n  Tier 3  facts for THIS intent only        (per turn)\n\nIntent-keyed topic index — not vector search.\nA turn carries 5–20 facts, not all 47.\nRetrieved fact IDs are recorded for Layer 5.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
