      "text": "LAYER 5 · EGRESS GUARDRAIL\n\n(a) guardrails/egress.py — ALWAYS ON, ~$0\n    currency · numbers ≥100 · URLs · phones\n    medical advice · coverage claims · voice artifacts\n    checked against retrieved fact IDs + tool results\n\n(b) guardrails/grounding.py — claim-bearing turns\n    entailment check vs the closed fact set\n    catches paraphrase with no literal to match",
