      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10029,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REPAIR → FALLBACK\n\nViolations fed back with the draft.\nModel sees its own output + what was wrong.\n\nBOUNDED AT 1 ATTEMPT.\nA second failure means the KB lacks the fact —\nthat is a handoff condition, not a retry condition.\n\nStill failing → GROUNDING_FALLBACK\n\"let me have someone follow up\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "repair",
      "originalText": "REPAIR → FALLBACK\n\nViolations fed back with the draft.\nModel sees its own output + what was wrong.\n\nBOUNDED AT 1 ATTEMPT.\nA second failure means the KB lacks the fact —\nthat is a handoff condition, not a retry condition.\n\nStill failing → GROUNDING_FALLBACK\n\"let me have someone follow up\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 11
    },
