      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10051,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY THIS ORDER\n\nCrisis detection MUST precede generation.\nVerification MUST precede delivery.\n\nThese are safety properties. A property you\nwant guaranteed does not belong in a model's\ndiscretion — so the pipeline is an explicit\nsequence, not an agent loop choosing its\nown control flow.\n\nDEGRADATION\nAPI down    → regex floor still catches crises\nClassifier off → paraphrase coverage narrows,\n                 floor holds\nVerifier down  → warn, don't block; the\n                 deterministic layer already passed",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "note",
      "originalText": "WHY THIS ORDER\n\nCrisis detection MUST precede generation.\nVerification MUST precede delivery.\n\nThese are safety properties. A property you\nwant guaranteed does not belong in a model's\ndiscretion — so the pipeline is an explicit\nsequence, not an agent loop choosing its\nown control flow.\n\nDEGRADATION\nAPI down    → regex floor still catches crises\nClassifier off → paraphrase coverage narrows,\n                 floor holds\nVerifier down  → warn, don't block; the\n                 deterministic layer already passed",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 11
    }
